{"id":43781,"date":"2026-06-30T10:39:37","date_gmt":"2026-06-30T14:39:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/upwithwomenstg.wpengine.com\/?page_id=43781"},"modified":"2026-06-30T10:56:08","modified_gmt":"2026-06-30T14:56:08","slug":"the-hidden-realities-of-gendered-poverty-in-canada","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/changing-the-conversation\/newsletter\/the-hidden-realities-of-gendered-poverty-in-canada\/","title":{"rendered":"THE HIDDEN REALITIES OF GENDERED POVERTY IN CANADA"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section alignfull alignfull\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-left-medium getwid-padding-right-medium\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>BEYOND THE HEADLINES: THE HIDDEN REALITIES OF GENDERED POVERTY IN CANADA<\/strong><\/h1>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The rising cost of living and increasing barriers to life\u2019s essentials have become defining realities for many Canadians. Yet many of the realities driving gendered poverty remain largely unseen.<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:31px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section getwid-anim fadeIn\" data-wow-duration=\"1500ms\" data-wow-delay=\"200ms\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background has-transparent-background-color\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF00\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-0dae7f45c0ec4c6b7cf8ea636c800586 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-custom-white-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"box-shadow:var(--wp--preset--shadow--sharp)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-custom-white-background-color has-background is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-counter\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-counter__wrapper\" style=\"text-align:center\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"235\" data-decimal-places=\"0\" data-duration=\"3\" data-use-easing=\"true\" data-use-grouping=\"true\" data-separator=\",\" data-decimal=\".\" data-easing-fn=\"outExpo\" data-numerals=\"default\"><span class=\"wp-block-getwid-counter__number has-text-color has-custom-black-color\">0<\/span><p class=\"wp-block-getwid-counter__suffix\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-custom-black-color\">K<\/mark><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-default has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-d7f723f680664249be2f96c49a1f7ece\">EXPERIENCE <mark style=\"background-color:#